<title>USA: NYCE certificated cotton stocks rise to 185,617.</title>
<headline>NYCE certificated cotton stocks rise to 185,617.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of June 12 totaled 185,617 bales, up from 185,220 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 505 bales issued, 944 bales awaiting review, 108 cancellations, and 11,376 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
